{"html":"<header class=\"spec-title-strip\">\n<div class=\"spec-title-col\">\n<div class=\"spec-family-crumb\">\n            FAMILY 10 · <span class=\"lang-zh\">生成模型：从潜变量与对抗学习到 diffusion、flow 与 consistency</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Generative, Diffusion &amp; Flow</span>\n</div>\n<h3 class=\"spec-model-title\" id=\"model_046_cyclegan-title\">CycleGAN</h3>\n<p class=\"spec-thesis-text lang-zh\">双生成器、双 PatchGAN 与 X→Y→X / Y→X→Y 两个 cycle L1 闭环，使不成对域转换可训练。</p>\n<p class=\"spec-thesis-en lang-en\">Couples dual generators (G: X→Y, F: Y→X) and dual PatchGAN discriminators with forward and backward L1 cycle-consistency loops for unpaired translation.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"spec-tensor-col\">\n<div class=\"tensor-row\">\n<span class=\"tensor-kicker\">INPUT DOMAIN // 输入域</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val lang-zh\">两组不成对的域 X 与域 Y 图像</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val tensor-val-en lang-en\">Two unpaired collections of images from source domain X and target domain Y</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"tensor-row\">\n<span class=\"tensor-kicker\">OUTPUT TARGET // 输出目标</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val lang-zh\">X→Y 与 Y→X 两个方向的域转换图像</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val tensor-val-en lang-en\">Bi-directional domain-translated images G(x) ∈ Y and F(y) ∈ X</span>\n</div>\n</div>\n</header><div class=\"model-full-body\">\n<!-- Main Split: Original Figure Plate (Left) + Forward Computation Graph (Right) -->\n<div class=\"spec-blueprint-grid\">\n<section class=\"spec-figure-plate\">\n<div class=\"plate-header\">\n<div class=\"plate-header-left\">\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">PRIMARY FIGURE // Figure 3 · PDF p.3</span>\n<h4 class=\"plate-title\">\n<span class=\"lang-zh\">论文原始方法示意图</span>\n<span class=\"lang-en\">Original Paper Architecture Diagram</span>\n</h4>\n</div>\n<div class=\"plate-header-right\">\n<a class=\"plate-source-link\" href=\"https://openaccess.thecvf.com/content_iccv_2017/html/Zhu_Unpaired_Image-To-Image_Translation_ICCV_2017_paper.html\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>SOURCE PDF</span><svg class=\"ui-icon-xs\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M7 17L17 7M9 7h8v8\"></path></svg></a>\n<button class=\"plate-zoom-btn\" data-call-click=\"openLightbox('architecture_model_046_cyclegan')\" type=\"button\"><svg class=\"ui-icon\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M15 3h6v6M9 21H3v-6M21 3l-7 7M3 21l7-7\"></path></svg><span>FULLSCREEN LIGHTBOX</span></button>\n</div>\n</div>\n<figure class=\"arch-figure-box\" data-call-click=\"openLightbox('architecture_model_046_cyclegan')\" title=\"Click to open interactive pan &amp; zoom viewer\">\n<img alt=\"CycleGAN original paper architecture figure, Figure 3\" class=\"arch-figure-img\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/b10da645cce0d9858b09.avif\"/>\n<figcaption class=\"plate-caption\">CLICK FIGURE TO OPEN INTERACTIVE PAN &amp; ZOOM VIEWER · Figure 3 · PDF p.3</figcaption>\n</figure>\n</section>\n<aside class=\"spec-circuit-panel\">\n<div class=\"circuit-header\">\n<div>\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">COMPUTATION GRAPH // 10 STAGES</span>\n<h4 class=\"plate-title\">\n<span class=\"lang-zh\">架构前向计算节点拆解</span>\n<span class=\"lang-en\">Forward Pass Computation Nodes</span>\n</h4>\n</div>\n<div class=\"circuit-controls\">\n<button class=\"circuit-btn\" data-call-click=\"stepArchNode('architecture_model_046_cyclegan', -1)\" title=\"Previous Stage\" type=\"button\">◁</button>\n<button class=\"circuit-btn circuit-play-btn\" data-play-id=\"architecture_model_046_cyclegan\" data-call-click=\"toggleAutoPlayNodes('architecture_model_046_cyclegan')\" title=\"Auto-Trace Computation Graph\" type=\"button\">AUTO</button>\n<button class=\"circuit-btn\" data-call-click=\"stepArchNode('architecture_model_046_cyclegan', 1)\" title=\"Next Stage\" type=\"button\">▷</button>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"active-node-spotlight\" id=\"spotlight-architecture_model_046_cyclegan\">\n<span class=\"spotlight-badge\">\n                STAGE 01 / 10 · <span class=\"lang-zh\">真实域 X</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Stage 01</span>\n</span>\n<span class=\"spotlight-text lang-zh\">从源域边缘分布独立采样，无需与 Y 样本一一对应。</span>\n<span class=\"spotlight-text spotlight-text-en lang-en\">Ingests two unpaired collections of images from source domain x and target domain y and prepares initial tensor representations (Stage 01).</span>\n</div>\n<ol class=\"circuit-timeline\">\n<li class=\"circuit-node active\" data-node-desc=\"从源域边缘分布独立采样，无需与 Y 样本一一对应。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Ingests two unpaired collections of images from source domain x and target domain y and prepares initial tensor representations (Stage 01).\" data-node-idx=\"0\" data-node-name=\"真实域 X\" data-node-name-en=\"Stage 01\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_046_cyclegan', 0)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">01</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">真实域 X</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Stage 01</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">从源域边缘分布独立采样，无需与 Y 样本一一对应。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Ingests two unpaired collections of images from source domain x and target domain y and prepares initial tensor representations (Stage 01).</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"从目标域边缘分布独立采样，不要求同患者或配准。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Executes Stage 02 to extract primary structural features and establish spatial/sequence encoding.\" data-node-idx=\"1\" data-node-name=\"真实域 Y\" data-node-name-en=\"Stage 02\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_046_cyclegan', 1)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">02</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">真实域 Y</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Stage 02</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">从目标域边缘分布独立采样，不要求同患者或配准。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Executes Stage 02 to extract primary structural features and establish spatial/sequence encoding.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"残差式 generator 把 X 图像映射为 Y 风格。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs Generator G:X→Y within the core unpaired bidirectional cycle consistent gan computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"2\" data-node-name=\"Generator G:X→Y\" data-node-name-en=\"Generator G:X→Y\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_046_cyclegan', 2)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">03</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>Generator G:X→Y</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">残差式 generator 把 X 图像映射为 Y 风格。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs Generator G:X→Y within the core unpaired bidirectional cycle consistent gan computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"第二个 generator 学习反方向 Y→X 映射。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs Generator F:Y→X within the core unpaired bidirectional cycle consistent gan computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"3\" data-node-name=\"Generator F:Y→X\" data-node-name-en=\"Generator F:Y→X\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_046_cyclegan', 3)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">04</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>Generator F:Y→X</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">第二个 generator 学习反方向 Y→X 映射。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs Generator F:Y→X within the core unpaired bidirectional cycle consistent gan computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"G(x) 应在外观上不可与真实域 Y 区分。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs Ŷ within the core unpaired bidirectional cycle consistent gan computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"4\" data-node-name=\"生成 Ŷ\" data-node-name-en=\"Ŷ\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_046_cyclegan', 4)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">05</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">生成 Ŷ</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Ŷ</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">G(x) 应在外观上不可与真实域 Y 区分。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs Ŷ within the core unpaired bidirectional cycle consistent gan computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"F(y) 应在外观上不可与真实域 X 区分。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs X̂ within the core unpaired bidirectional cycle consistent gan computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"5\" data-node-name=\"生成 X̂\" data-node-name-en=\"X̂\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_046_cyclegan', 5)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">06</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">生成 X̂</span><span class=\"lang-en\">X̂</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">F(y) 应在外观上不可与真实域 X 区分。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs X̂ within the core unpaired bidirectional cycle consistent gan computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"区分真实 y 与 G(x)，约束 X→Y 的目标域局部纹理。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs PatchGAN D_Y within the core unpaired bidirectional cycle consistent gan computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"6\" data-node-name=\"PatchGAN D_Y\" data-node-name-en=\"PatchGAN D_Y\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_046_cyclegan', 6)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">07</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>PatchGAN D_Y</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">区分真实 y 与 G(x)，约束 X→Y 的目标域局部纹理。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs PatchGAN D_Y within the core unpaired bidirectional cycle consistent gan computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"区分真实 x 与 F(y)，约束 Y→X 的目标域局部纹理。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs PatchGAN D_X within the core unpaired bidirectional cycle consistent gan computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"7\" data-node-name=\"PatchGAN D_X\" data-node-name-en=\"PatchGAN D_X\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_046_cyclegan', 7)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">08</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>PatchGAN D_X</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">区分真实 x 与 F(y)，约束 Y→X 的目标域局部纹理。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs PatchGAN D_X within the core unpaired bidirectional cycle consistent gan computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"F(G(x)) 应回到原 x，以 L1 cycle loss 约束前向映射可逆。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Applies Cycle reconstruction x̃ to project aggregated representations toward the target task head.\" data-node-idx=\"8\" data-node-name=\"Cycle 重建 x̃\" data-node-name-en=\"Cycle reconstruction x̃\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_046_cyclegan', 8)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">09</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">Cycle 重建 x̃</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Cycle reconstruction x̃</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">F(G(x)) 应回到原 x，以 L1 cycle loss 约束前向映射可逆。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Applies Cycle reconstruction x̃ to project aggregated representations toward the target task head.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"G(F(y)) 应回到原 y，以 L1 cycle loss 约束反向映射可逆。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Produces bi-directional domain-translated images g(x) ∈ y and f(y) ∈ x via Cycle reconstruction ỹ.\" data-node-idx=\"9\" data-node-name=\"Cycle 重建 ỹ\" data-node-name-en=\"Cycle reconstruction ỹ\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_046_cyclegan', 9)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">10</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">Cycle 重建 ỹ</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Cycle reconstruction ỹ</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">G(F(y)) 应回到原 y，以 L1 cycle loss 约束反向映射可逆。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Produces bi-directional domain-translated images g(x) ∈ y and f(y) ∈ x via Cycle reconstruction ỹ.</span></div></li>\n</ol>\n</aside>\n</div>\n<!-- Mathematical Formalism Band -->\n<section aria-label=\"CycleGAN Mathematical Formalism\" class=\"spec-math-band\">\n<div class=\"math-meta-col\">\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">MATHEMATICAL FORMALISM</span>\n<div class=\"math-title-text lang-zh\">核心公式 · CycleGAN 的双向对抗与两个循环一致性闭环</div>\n<div class=\"math-title-en lang-en\">Core Formalism · Bidirectional Adversarial Losses + Forward/Backward Cycle Consistency (X→Y→X &amp; Y→X→Y)</div>\n</div>\n<div aria-label=\"CycleGAN：核心公式 · CycleGAN 的双向对抗与两个循环一致性闭环\" class=\"tex-formula-vector\" role=\"img\">\n<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" data-formula-index=\"46\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"10.110738pt\" preserveaspectratio=\"xMidYMid meet\" style=\"display:block;width:auto;max-width:100%;height:auto;max-height:96px;margin:0 auto\" version=\"1.1\" viewbox=\"-68.742477 -69.079189 333.894903 10.110738\" width=\"333.894903pt\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><defs><path d=\"M2.85475 0V-.108683C2.282351-.115929 2.166422-.188385 2.166422-.536171V-4.883507L2.108458-4.897998L.804257-4.238652V-4.137214C.891204-4.173442 .970905-4.202424 .999887-4.216916C1.130307-4.267635 1.253482-4.296617 1.325937-4.296617C1.478094-4.296617 1.543304-4.187933 1.543304-3.956075V-.673837C1.543304-.434734 1.48534-.268086 1.369411-.202876C1.260727-.137666 1.15929-.115929 .854976-.108683V0H2.85475Z\" id=\"m046_g15-49\"></path><path d=\"M5.115365 0V-.137666C4.789315-.159402 4.716859-.231858 4.463265-.768029L2.65912-4.883507H2.514209L1.007133-1.325937C.543417-.268086 .45647-.159402 .108683-.137666V0H1.543304V-.137666C1.195517-.137666 1.050606-.231858 1.050606-.434734C1.050606-.52168 1.072343-.623118 1.108571-.71731L1.441